      "papers": [],
      "scope": "Darwin pthread_join return model for the resize graph. A join of a worker that is not joining the owner waits for thread exit and returns 0. A join while the worker blocks on the owner's mutex does not return and is not EDEADLK. An owner join that starts before the worker joins the owner does not return. EDEADLK 11 occurs only when the worker is already inside pthread_join of the owner, and the same owner's next join stays 11 until that worker has left. A pre-join flag does not close the gate. The resize graph cannot record 11 and then a same-owner 0. Milestone stays 8. Not a source patch and not 9/12."
    }
  ]
